  "readme_intro": "A full-side-on west freighter under its own open wheelhouse, twin-root counterweight mast, descending two-cable freight line with three material cargo gondolas, a compact mono-spine sorter above a lower bypass, a stepped east rail/export/customs settlement, and a continuous excavated rescue tunnel. Upper transfer portal, entered ship hatch and separate lower shafts are source-cell geometry. Distinct from the corpus ring, arch, broken-trestle and gorge-bridge precedents. The cable gondolas are fixed authored solids, not simulated vehicles; editable cargo-release, sorter and underground setpiece sites remain unprogrammed."
